{'symbol': 'HSY', 'date': '2022-08-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'THE HERSHEY COMPANY NAMES MARLENE CREIGHTON GLOBAL CHIEF SALES OFFICER', 'text': 'HERSHEY, PA. , AUG. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HERSHEY COMPANY (NYSE: HSY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MARLENE CREIGHTON HAS BEEN NAMED AS GLOBAL CHIEF SALES OFFICER, EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 5, 2022.'}